WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.083
- CALL DAK.

00:00:01.083 --> 00:00:03.250
CALL DAKOTA PRESCOTT.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.708
How do I work this thing?

00:00:04.916 --> 00:00:07.000
- Shhhh, guys, keep it down.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Hello, Mr. Jones.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.500
- Hey, bud, just calling for our 
daily contract negotiation!

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.875
How about four years, $20 million a year,
and I’ll throw in a half a dozen oil rigs?

00:00:13.875 --> 00:00:15.541
- I want $35 million a year.

00:00:15.541 --> 00:00:17.666
- [Laughs] Oh, Dakky, you're ridiculous.

00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:19.541
That’s what Russell Wilson makes, hahaha.

00:00:19.541 --> 00:00:20.791
Oh. You’re serious.

00:00:20.791 --> 00:00:21.791
- I deserve it, sir.

00:00:21.791 --> 00:00:22.791
I’m a great leader.

00:00:22.791 --> 00:00:24.666
Just have the caterers come in. It’s fine.

00:00:24.666 --> 00:00:26.250
- OK, how about $25 million,

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.083
and I'll let you add a fifth play into 
Mike McCarthy’s playbook?

00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:30.583
Are you having another hootenanny?!

00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:32.916
- Uh, no. I made this ice sculpture myself.

00:00:32.916 --> 00:00:35.125
- Good. We need to be socially distant.

00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:36.666
OK, here, let me add Zeke.

00:00:36.666 --> 00:00:37.333
- Sup, Jerry?

00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:39.750
- Hey, Zeke, tell Dak we want him on the team.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.375
- HEY, DAK, WE WANT YOU ON THE TEAM.

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:42.541
- You paid Zeke.

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:43.750
You paid Amari.

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:44.875
I need to get what’s mine.

00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:47.458
- Wait, did you invite Jason Garrett 
to your little hoedown, Dak?

00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:49.041
Ah commo—shouldn’t he be in New York?

00:00:49.041 --> 00:00:50.208
- Oh right, I gotta go.

00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:52.333
- No, sir, you’re old, and you're 
just imagining things again.

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:56.000
- I do sometimes think it’s the '90s, 
but it makes me so happy…

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.208
- It’s a different time now.

00:00:57.208 --> 00:00:59.083
JARED GOFF got $33.5 million.

00:00:59.083 --> 00:01:00.541
I’m better than him, right?

00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:02.333
- Right.

00:01:02.333 --> 00:01:05.625
OK, maybe I can convince Amari 
to give me back some of that $100 million.

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:06.791
- Hello, Mr. Jones—

00:01:06.791 --> 00:01:09.083
- AHHHHHHHHHHHHhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!

00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:11.708
- How about $36 mill, 
and I invite you to my next illegal party?

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:14.541
- If you.

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:15.416
- Liked

00:01:15.416 --> 00:01:16.291
- This video

00:01:16.291 --> 00:01:17.000
- Subscribe below

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:17.416
- For more.

00:01:17.416 --> 00:01:18.125
- Or we’re not

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:18.666
- Jason

00:01:18.666 --> 00:01:19.750
- And Jason McCourtey.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:20.791
- No, you’re Devin.

00:01:20.791 --> 00:01:22.500
- I’m pretty sure you’re Devin.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:23.541
- Which of us is Devin?

00:01:23.541 --> 00:01:24.666
- Uh, you!

00:01:24.666 --> 00:01:25.625
- ME?

00:01:25.625 --> 00:01:26.041
- I’ll be Devin.

00:01:26.041 --> 00:01:26.666
- Thanks Jason.

